flowchart TD
    box_0(["Start"])
    box_1["Record the read failure rate (number of failed reads<br/>per hundred parts), the error type shown on the<br/>operator control interface, and the batch number of<br/>the affected parts."]
    box_2{"Is the read failure occurring on all parts or only<br/>on a fraction of the batch?"}
    box_3["Complete the following checks: 1. Inspect five<br/>failed parts for inconsistent marking contrast. 2.<br/>Compare with a successfully read part from the same<br/>batch."]
    box_4["Complete the following checks: 1. Check the read<br/>history log on the code reader diagnostic display.<br/>2. Verify the failure rate is consistent across all<br/>positions on the part. 3. Check for a correlation<br/>between failures and a specific part feature."]
    box_5{"Is the marking contrast on the affected parts within<br/>the minimum contrast specification?"}
    box_6["Measure the optical contrast of the code marking on<br/>three failed parts using the contrast measurement<br/>tool and compare against the minimum contrast<br/>threshold."]
    box_7["Adjust the laser power or marking speed at the<br/>marking station to restore contrast to within<br/>specification. remark the affected parts if<br/>feasible."]
    box_8{"Is the code reader lens clean and free of<br/>contamination?"}
    box_9["Inspect the code reader lens surface for dust, oil,<br/>or condensation. Verify that the reader housing<br/>cover is intact and that no stray light enters the<br/>reading field."]
    box_10["Clean the code reader lens with an approved optical<br/>cleaning cloth and lens cleaner. retest the read<br/>rate with five known good parts."]
    box_11{"Is the illumination intensity at the reading<br/>position within specification?"}
    box_12["Complete the following checks: 1. Read the<br/>illumination intensity from the code reader<br/>diagnostic display. 2. Compare against the minimum<br/>specified illumination level. 3. Check the<br/>illumination module for contamination or connector<br/>issues."]
    box_13["Replace the illuminator indicator light module if<br/>the output is below specification. retest the read<br/>rate after replacement."]
    box_14{"Is the code geometry (module size, quiet zone,<br/>aspect ratio) within the specification for this code<br/>type?"}
    box_15["Use the code reader diagnostic software to inspect<br/>the decoded code geometry parameters. Compare module<br/>size and quiet zone width against the code<br/>specification for this product."]
    box_16["Remark the affected parts at the correct code<br/>geometry specification, or reject the batch if the<br/>marking station cannot produce the correct geometry."]
    box_17{"Has the read success rate returned to within the<br/>acceptable threshold after corrections?"}
    box_18["Escalate to the maintenance team: code read failures<br/>persist after all standard corrective actions;<br/>inspect the code reader mounting, focus, and trigger<br/>timing."]
    box_19["Record all corrective actions and the final read<br/>success rate in the quality log. Notify quality<br/>assurance team of the affected batch."]
    box_20(["End, resume production."])
    box_21{"Is the code read failure rate so high that part<br/>traceability cannot be maintained, requiring an<br/>immediate production stop and traceability audit?"}
    box_22(["End, production stopped immediately: traceability<br/>compromised, quarantine all unverified parts from<br/>current shift and escalate to quality assurance<br/>engineer"])

